---
#3959, §14.1 `bynk.given.kind_needs_parameter` in a test-only commons (track §4): its
`given` follows the commons rule, not the suite helper's, so a bare `Kv` is refused here too.
---
commons lib.cache for tests

consumes bynk.cloudflare { Kv }

fn seed(key: String) -> Effect[()] given Kv {
	Kv.put(key, "v")
}
